#: data/io.github.astrovm.AdventureMods.desktop.in data/io.github.astrovm.AdventureMods.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Set up Sonic Adventure mods"
msgstr "Configura i mod di Sonic Adventure"

#: data/io.github.astrovm.AdventureMods.desktop.in
